#: scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21a5b4cd07690c69cc397f8458a39b3151c3c8bc5f14cb3d6f4a3b21041ab6a4
#. default-sha256: f2ebe3af38b91650599be5fe9cb37a1d290fe15ce60b0e5b306abeb743f577c4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It had been about a week since the White-Haired Girl had taken up residence in the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il s’était écoulé une semaine depuis que la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs s’était installée au "
"manoir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51624a342eb97dd9343132248ba5ec49877de26216a44208d2a7a9c877444332
#. default-sha256: 45458a155e3fd79fe330533c8d83b029546a27f409fe782af7ae59aca81dc309
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Staying in that house deprived of light was, I imagine, a very claustrophobic experience."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vivre dans une maison à ce point dénuée de lumière est une expérience, je pense, à rendre "
"claustrophobe n’importe qui."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfd7bef1c1c1d2cab480eb5d221aed5d44c02c51c987dce64aae4ae5f7bfdd2a
#. default-sha256: fd54f98f4d2b8faed3809935908351e44ab98406ecfa088a0f92072bcd438067
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To anyone blessed enough to have sunlight as a part of their everyday lives, it would have "
"been unbearable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quiconque habitué un tant soit peu à la lumière du soleil aurait trouvé cela insupportable "
"au quotidien."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a5dc52d8ae319dfc17d2f0cfa4dce1efdb433341e36aeb6109a2af9b817b654
#. default-sha256: 37a06957c8cddb1e6220bd5e73427e9823a02d80c80263f16975738bf8366b03
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But for her, the mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫with its prison walls and lack of either illumination or "
"recreation—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais pour elle, le manoir —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ avec ses murs de prison et son manque de lumière ou de "
"loisir —"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87c03b6cd168c20dedf4228b88a0e3562488be97231b42afcb38ba2ca650deea
#. default-sha256: ebb6c0939a1ee12ab5f54296f2f2c30841edea141832feec8c0c40d5cfa96f0a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was the one place she could find respite."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫était le seul endroit où elle bénéficiait de répit."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de4c11ad5e9376f16e2c9c5f734e04631e093b6385e0450f26f9a3b972ae19d0
#. default-sha256: 0dad4bfdda7fadc726f0c5b96c8efbea76342dc21f1c0f2afde12de251e15768
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She and Michel continued to be distant, however."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Michel et elle gardaient leurs distances, pourtant."

#: scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29235586aaca7f78fc8aceeca29a8f2d756e397548d3a4302e3a530749e8e088
#. default-sha256: e127a3e72955306dc42ed8e78db2ae0db515cce47b8b5b863307cd7e1a4aac93
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He spent most of his time in his chambers, which he had explicitly told the White-Haired "
"Girl to stay out of, leaving her unable to close that gap."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il passait le plus clair de son temps dans sa chambre, où il avait formellement interdit à "
"la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs de pénétrer, ce qui l’empêchait d’améliorer les choses en se "
"rapprochant de lui."

#: scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9a19825f06c0439774b3640d30aff3d70660bf16addd6fe859d63970157d836
#. default-sha256: b65f5fa2a854ce3e7ac46d1df48c77dab83cb43de4c8b0c6125bd25de3851df4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, on the occasions they did cross paths in the hallway,⟪k:1⟫their eyes would meet—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if but briefly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Néanmoins, ils se croisaient de temps à autre dans le couloir,⟪k:1⟫ils échangeaient un regard"
"—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ ne serait-ce qu’un instant."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c41bc6cb9311d6a998a96fb2c74ce361764e3dfa3913a760f9c7d0390a0ddf0b
#. default-sha256: 3070fb0969847a9d9653156d4d031d81268f6cc8473086a47001546b972e8edf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was never for more than a few seconds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whenever she saw him, she made a point of "
"giving him a little smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cela ne durait jamais plus de quelques secondes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫À⟪k:4⟫ chaque fois qu’elle le "
"voyait, elle ne manquait pas de lui faire un petit sourire."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdf75ba76f9f504a839568709e58a0a27a5b4441396edaf391d980d83958d682
#. default-sha256: d5017667b85e7183baca7c1c494435dcccfe3173f750228383f0bf5efeda6800
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He never said anything, but still, when she had first arrived, he would not have even met "
"her gaze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ne disait jamais rien mais, comparé à son arrivée où il ne daignait même pas la regarder, "
"il y avait du progrès."

#: scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01c2dfa65fd776c845da41e8eeeba2fee8821753119be6c88b58752285ec70ef
#. default-sha256: 1f9e3f1ba2f16bcbc1b97eae5a829cf2399b9683f01297366bf37fce1367b42d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to be taking more and more notice of her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il semblait faire de plus en plus attention à elle."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83c97124f1e03e1c1dca0470a5b58f9d9368d63a5aef9744301ccbc05bf360c5
#. default-sha256: bd52c90fd1c0dfc8b64c6f79753441970ef0692eefa754a4a022266a2b79d761
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, the White-Haired Girl stood in the cellar, a frown on her face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un jour, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs alla dans la cave, soucieuse."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea93f0c397ebd759cd7ca083e454699856eb941de3f3a2af39b95574e74d7202
#. default-sha256: e4285b508cd7c2db44241379ae2fd84a5ad2b28bfa018f9bcc3dbde6c9c30ac1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Well, this is troubling...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can’t go down to the village...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but if we "
"don’t do something soon...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Mince, c’est embêtant...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je ne peux pas descendre au village...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...mais "
"si l’on ne fait rien rapidement...)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a276dd232ac2a42f577922d5aec3fdb827b2884698374b8553ad6b59044cca3d
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a81087e04f3da29ae9b75c8114f993a87cc7177613987fc42d7cd78c51965c47
#. default-sha256: 85e84edba36163c68ebd6942008082403dbf151e8004a242f7a2383f65729ecf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where their food was stored—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫an assortment of nonperishables and "
"dried foods, smoked meats and cheeses."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Leurs provisions étaient stockées à la cave—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ c’était un assortiment de produits "
"non périssables, d’aliments séchés, de viande et de fromage fumés."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 815c970132f72300a8f292b29ca482167b91e0c703cd66c3a160dae42776347d
#. default-sha256: 5bd8f0d63e561cbefb3bc293d0aa8362a508102c7e7c314ea072fe76f88eb7c1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her daily meals were taken from the supplies there. ⟪k:1⟫However, the stockpile was "
"beginning to grow quite small."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ces vivres leur fournissaient leurs repas quotidiens. ⟪k:1⟫Mais les réserves commençaient à "
"s’épuiser."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38b3ccf75e22a507d0da8e103ec878abcae6d4f7806b653aa787f434b331d07b
#. default-sha256: 9ac378fa375ee43925d45dad61f0498ecf7ce28b9adde537160e96d9f1774ce3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Were she not on the run, she could have gone to the village to procure more."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si elle n’avait pas été pourchassée, elle aurait pu aller au village s’en procurer davantage."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2dc51fa75170d22452ad263d8bea9f339eaf841891f8f8a1a7cb7cf960b7a060
#. default-sha256: 3207483c2d01e89bbcdaa132c77a6a6e1985cfa2f74d31f5ccf83e2e480cca46
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps, were she a little tougher, she could have captured a wild animal for its meat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ou bien, si elle en avait eu le cran, elle aurait pu capturer un animal sauvage pour le "
"manger."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5a43137a39561fd78a5977f6de656c691ca6680f27d3a6dbee422128dd33911
#. default-sha256: ab255acfd97066e5b64b52b640c0e4d72859347fd932143d94610b88ab53ecb4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫But Master, you know a young, delicate thing like her was hardly up to the task "
"of hunting for food."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Héhé... ⟪k:1⟫Mais vous savez, Maître, une petite chose délicate comme elle n’était pas en "
"mesure d’aller chasser."

#: scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de50e9f982cfcb0391b2a9eac029140cf6df23928b409630b92f63ba39ce48fa
#. default-sha256: 84d651c689076c8a574cfad121b2c11a07d6cbbfe898108c205344f408e23c84
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How does he normally get his supplies, I wonder?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comment fait-il pour se réapprovisionner, d’habitude ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1ae3209e027d925e8bad8b092a4b5e5ae7166fbf03764fbbf22d623084e80cf
#. default-sha256: ee2e87b8c7e85db429daa0dd21df5b663f1d025e14019930e2808f4ff346f517
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From there, other questions about Michel started rising in her mind. ⟪k:1⟫No matter how "
"lifeless he seemed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De là, d’autres questions concernant Michel commencèrent à surgir dans son esprit. ⟪k:1⟫Il "
"avait beau avoir l’air d’être dénué de toute vie..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f30ae68e8dd56b55722c8e039d634006efdb3250802196e57e0ae6a9a8333fe0
#. default-sha256: 95da300c2b555721f6cf0d629077ee21f968d82d379a8a5502a981c1c085205b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫surely⟪k:2⟫ he still had to eat, right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...il devait ⟪k:1⟫quand même⟪k:2⟫ se nourrir, non ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 852fb477501147c77c2ba2754e9f7e45d203501a97e4b30b08971871fc1b7905
#. default-sha256: afd7dc1ee653a85e35af14ac8d30679e26271ac62bbda432da5d4fc1990bfc7f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl nodded, then made her way out of the cellar, intending to head for his "
"bedchamber."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs hocha de la tête et sortit de la cave, résolue à lui rendre "
"visite dans sa chambre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 135c5bfebe0e866827c6878b1966163ab2f427a39095a4a6156b97f568674cf2
#. default-sha256: 288ec68d25382eb9433193b808702d17a96fb8a94b27f7c2ed05e9d8f26f4930
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eecf0ea841daa2224df2be7eb9e71fca3cdcd695ee37a63a0534ddeaa7a429d5
#. default-sha256: 1ece06ae1b0fc4f51dd2801bbf0ed8a8ad7a92a16765e6a11e2adfaf381bb7c6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But on her way there, she spotted him standing by the entrance,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais sur le chemin, elle le vit, près de l’entrée,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E0603546_E5DC_49EA_85A5_308CDFAB747B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25c6ad026426a33100882d2801c90107f06f5a90cf2d1669df5b7128685eb7a0
#. default-sha256: 55a17bfe1b67a698886d2cfa257d4d41f86a919471108d5d4d3b8cc43673864d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E0603546_E5DC_49EA_85A5_308CDFAB747B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫staring motionless at the door, lit by a single candle. ⟪k:1⟫He appeared to be waiting for "
"something."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫immobile, à regarder fixement la porte, éclairée par une seule bougie. ⟪k:1⟫Il semblait "
"attendre quelque chose."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F165E07F_0730_4DD0_BBF8_22866D9D8BAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f00cb7e4592879ef49c24ef2ffe76b06d4793a7079c3e944ebf376f77197323
#. default-sha256: 030363909027532602cf896a870e63785a72322b015471851ed1c132e87685eb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F165E07F_0730_4DD0_BBF8_22866D9D8BAE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Um..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Euh..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_561B3E19_6D73_4271_B805_36A8F0766D4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33cfe2ab2802f9c576c06961c86ff2364362be144e518ae8b8a709920d69f962
#. default-sha256: 1c812955ab9bac78e3a90e06d812791e1961c834f796f1436b7f9a497f0f3238
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_561B3E19_6D73_4271_B805_36A8F0766D4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"

