msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The White-Haired Girl turned toward Michel to press him for more information, but "
"he averted his gaze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs se tourna vers Michel pour lui poser plus de questions "
"mais il détourna le regard."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1F5C2A12_B0D4_494D_A3B2_985FDD6108FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90efaf0b58feae361cef47b5a017863e7c0c120743b02879eee98fc0892d73d7
#. default-sha256: 2aef3a102c3d99597c8faa17d3d580eeaf1f6bf8f43bbef0964ab61a753048b1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1F5C2A12_B0D4_494D_A3B2_985FDD6108FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Find the answer yourself,” he seemed to be saying. ⟪k:1⟫She took several moments to gather "
"her will, then marched over to the door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Trouvez la réponse vous-même », semblait-il lui dire. ⟪k:1⟫Elle prit son temps pour "
"rassembler son courage et se dirigea vers la porte."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A49AA1_107C_48B3_B095_397163E1A457
