msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BBCC5ABA_4508_42BE_9184_261D959B28C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sunlight—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫which she had not seen in some time—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was so bright it seemed "
"to burn her eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La lumière du soleil —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ qu’elle n’avait pas vue depuis un certain temps —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ "
"était si éclatante qu’elle en brûlait presque ses yeux."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 412e740152127aeadb667a78b8650450faa8de7ea87bcc7949fdd48505f30c81
#. default-sha256: dc64a82268f01e9544c0651538425606458136995356d03bb31cd1e1a8232607
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although the sun itself had not gotten any brighter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she had simply spent so much "
"time in the dark her eyes were no longer accustomed to that much light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le soleil n’avait pas gagné en intensité—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ elle avait simplement passé tant de "
"temps dans l’obscurité que ses yeux n’étaient plus habitués à une telle luminosité."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1743A20C_19DF_476A_BE0E_CF317A931797
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c370b08fdfaca62520170fca5b94ac92b7a8481179bbece73ad9e5774cd649ae
#. default-sha256: 8081eb3e3100ab2338120d430f6433f250885c58fb578fb4b9cb01bc61034945
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1743A20C_19DF_476A_BE0E_CF317A931797"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of her eyes made them quite sensitive to light already, so when she stepped "
"outside, her whole world went bone white."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La couleur de ses yeux la rendait déjà plus sensible à la lumière, donc quand elle sortit, "
"le monde entier était devenu tout blanc."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C2786865_DC4D_41E8_BA59_715BA2D60274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9799a9599b4f53527bc76b5467cd67bd5e9f99f0c3498507c769202239a7bb41
#. default-sha256: 97351911cca437f0c8e62a24525d7946a3ff6dde59d9926ad28ae435b832b028
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C2786865_DC4D_41E8_BA59_715BA2D60274"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl stood motionless for ten, perhaps fifteen seconds, and when her eyes "
"had finally adjusted to the light—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs resta immobile pendant dix, peut-être quinze secondes, et quand "
"ses yeux eurent fini de s’adapter à l’éclat ambiant—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A72FFAAD_4018_4430_967A_B3065CE21D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54a9466cc12fcbc0d5367d471277fa4b95cd0c05638fd5a4dbac369175f895e3
