msgid "⟪k:0⟫—she noticed a crate on the ground at her feet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫— elle remarqua une caisse posée au sol, à ses pieds."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E18C489C_F90A_45D4_A4F9_5E1E586BC899
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28ed3c6a1dc328f055debd35a96a1f785690aa260deddf2e1177ba51cc8ff1d2
