msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E18C489C_F90A_45D4_A4F9_5E1E586BC899"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She turned her head back to ask Michel about the box, but the mansion was so dark it "
"appeared to be wholly severed from the outside world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle tourna la tête pour demander à Michel ce qu’était cette boîte mais le manoir était si "
"sombre qu’il semblait totalement séparé du monde extérieur."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EB040506_815D_4D74_B184_D62A6E716113
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31afa6a1eb963d4b8ea69fd7561e22d928ad091702055a0f9d0a66ad13e68f71
#. default-sha256: f6eacb9dcbb9a4efa9c06ecd005309aad0f8373ae4167d1197eea9263c9cb80b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EB040506_815D_4D74_B184_D62A6E716113"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫From where she stood, she was unable to distinguish Michel from the shadows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De là où elle se tenait, elle était incapable de différencier Michel des ombres qui "
"l’entouraient."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54251AF9_3BA8_4E58_A34A_F13A62645D3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf918946d501f238c1d2db9853e524b2c42142e686d1c2edd0acf4d339dcf1c6
#. default-sha256: f017c8d1f8a97de3e923de9389891307af050a462b63e773bfe4bf4b644af1db
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54251AF9_3BA8_4E58_A34A_F13A62645D3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A pang of nervousness struck her; ⟪k:1⟫she wanted to return to that darkness as quickly as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tendue, elle eut un pincement au cœur ; ⟪k:1⟫ elle voulait retourner dans cette obscurité "
"aussi vite que possible."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3D73C680_7370_4AE8_B1E0_CE4E6095C60F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c30880cfe72189aea9a0f01490e4c7518e815fae29de046fa4b1e11429a3aa1
