msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had come to yearn for that world without light more than the one with."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs en était venue à préférer ce monde sans lumière."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E1152686_7214_4F5E_82C2_746A5CD16163
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae6ba4fe7affff8ca818f40bd195c9d879ca8e3e5e3856cad2889db5ca542a58
